<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-11977] Data streamer pool MXBean is registered as ThreadPoolMXBean instead of StripedExecutorMXBean</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11977</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Data streamer pool is registered with a ThreadPoolMXBean while it is actually a StripedExecutor and can use a StripedExecutorMXBean.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Need to change the registration in the IgniteKernal code. It should be registered the same way as the striped executor pool.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
